  "title": "Cucumber Gazpacho with Mint Paste",
  "description": "Looking for a cold, refreshing soup on a hot day? Try this cucumber gazpacho, garnished with a delicious mint paste with hazelnuts.",
  "authors": [
    "Barbara Sauermann"
  ],
